1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,570
Collision theory pictures a reaction as the result of collisions.

2
00:00:04,570 --> 00:00:07,122
First, molecules must collide.

3
00:00:07,122 --> 00:00:13,138
In a gas at room temperature there are about ten to the thirty collisions per litre every second.

4
00:00:13,138 --> 00:00:18,242
If every one worked, every gas reaction would be over in a microsecond.

